---
import StandardPageLayout from "../../layouts/StandardPageLayout.astro";
import FinancialStatementKey from "../../components/FinancialStatementKey.astro";
import Glossary from "../../components/Glossary.astro";
import PageToc from "../../components/PageToc.astro";
import "../../styles/standards-poster.css";
import "../../styles/extended.css";
import HistoryTimeline from "../../components/HistoryTimeline.astro";
import history from "../../data/history.json";
import metadata from "../../data/standards/usgaap/asc605.json";
---

<StandardPageLayout
  code={metadata.code}
  standardType={metadata.framework}
  title={metadata.title}
  description={metadata.description}
  issued={metadata.issued}
  latestAmendment={metadata.latestAmendment}
  status={metadata.status}
  summary={metadata.summary}
  bannerNotice={metadata.bannerNotice}
>
  <Fragment slot="toc">
    <PageToc
      items={[
        { id: "s1", label: "Overview" },
        { id: "s2", label: "Supersession by ASC 606" },
        { id: "s3", label: "IfRS Comparison" },
        { id: "s4", label: "Related Topics" },
      ]}
    />
  </Fragment>
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="section-header" id="s1"><span class="num">1</span><h2>Overview</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card cw span2"><div class="ctitle cw">What ASC 605 used to govern</div><div style="font-size: var(--text-small); color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">Before the 2014 revenue recognition overhaul, ASC 605 and its predecessor pronouncements—including SAB 101/104 and industry-specific guidance such as SOP 97-2 for software—provided the framework for revenue recognition under US GAAP. This framework was considerably less unified than the model that replaced it, consisting of dozens of industry-specific and transaction-specific pieces of guidance that often produced inconsistent results for economically similar transactions across different industries.</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header" id="s2"><span class="num">2</span><h2>Supersession by ASC 606</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card ci span2"><div class="ctitle ci">Replaced by a single, principle-based model</div><div style="font-size: var(--text-small); color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">The FASB and IASB undertook a joint project beginning in the early 2000s and finalised in 2014 to replace ASC 605's fragmented, industry-specific patchwork with a single, principle-based, converged model—resulting in <strong>ASC 606</strong> (US GAAP) and <strong>IFRS 15</strong> (IFRS), issued simultaneously with substantively identical wording. ASC 606 became effective for public entities in 2018 and private entities in 2019, at which point it superseded ASC 605 for essentially all revenue transactions.</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header" id="s3"><span class="num">3</span><h2>IfRS Comparison</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card cd span2"><div class="ctitle cd">Predecessor of IFRS 15</div><div style="font-size: var(--text-small); color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">IAS 18 (Revenue) and IAS 11 (Construction Contracts) played the analogous predecessor role under IFRS, similarly superseded by IFRS 15 as part of the same joint convergence project. Both frameworks retired their old, less unified revenue models at the same time, for the same converged replacement.</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header" id="s4"><span class="num">4</span><h2>Related Topics</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card cd"><div class="ctitle cd">Cross-reference map</div>
      <div class="td-table"><div class="th" style="grid-template-columns:0.8fr 2fr;"><span>Topic</span><span>Connection</span></div>
      <div class="tr" style="grid-template-columns:0.8fr 2fr;"><span>ASC 606</span><span>Current revenue recognition guidance—superseded ASC 605 for virtually all transactions</span></div>
      <div class="tr alt" style="grid-template-columns:0.8fr 2fr;"><span>IFRS 15</span><span>IFRS counterpart to ASC 606, issued simultaneously as part of the same convergence project</span></div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <FinancialStatementKey />

  </div>
  <section id="history">
    <HistoryTimeline items={history.ASC605 || []} />
  </section>
</StandardPageLayout>

